WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:10.310
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:21.320
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.800
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:37.270
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.310
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.610
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.480
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.690
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:01:00.360
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:09.040
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:16.040
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:21.520
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.680
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:45.410
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:49.280
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.980
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:58.520
And finally, the time had come for
them to defeat their last enemy, Zagato.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.950
Zagato stood in
and blocked their way.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:07.330
His attacks were powerful,
blowing them away many times.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:15.770
But the girls united their power and
cast a combination spell, Spiral Flash...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:18.670
...and managed to eradicate Zagato.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:25.350
The Unbelievable Truth
About the Legendary Magic Knights

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.760
Zagato...

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.850
Magic Knights...

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:08.330
Now we can finally fulfill
Princess Emeraude's wish!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:12.500
We revived the Rune-Gods and
defeated the one who abducted her.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.190
So Cephiro will be saved...

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.930
...and we can go back to Tokyo!

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.230
You know...

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.370
Umi... Fuu...

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:33.880
I'm really glad that I was
summoned to Cephiro with you two.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:38.450
If I was all by myself,
I don't think this would've happened...

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.060
I feel the same way, Hikaru.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.990
If I were alone...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:49.500
...I would've panicked and become
some monster's dinner in the first forest.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.370
Myself as well.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:57.210
I never would have known how to act
in a foreign world if I were by myself.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.460
Let's go! Umi! Fuu!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.490
I'm sure Princess
Emeraude is inside here!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.670
How do we get in?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.900
It looks like crystals.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.740
How do we...

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.470
That is the barrier
that protects this castle.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.370
That voice... Rayearth?

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.580
But Zagato is no longer...

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:37.750
This castle belongs
to Princess Emeraude.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.280
Selece...

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:44.390
This barrier was created by
Princess Emeraude's heart.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:45.850
Windam...

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:48.990
Thy magic can breach the barrier.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.520
Princess Emeraude is
beyond this barrier, right?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:56.790
The Pillar of Cephiro is within...

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.670
Let's go!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:04:59.440
Yeah!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.200
Yeah!
Yes.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.300
Girls from another world.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:05.340
The true enemy
of the Magic Knights...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.570
...is incomparably
stronger than anyone else.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:09.780
Be warned.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.510
What does that mean?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.710
The battle has already ended...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.150
Let's go to where
Princess Emeraude waits!

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.530
Flame Arrow!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.230
Water Dragon!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.670
Emerald Typhoon!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.080
Someone's here.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:19.680
It appears to be a woman.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.770
Who are you?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:37.960
I am...

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.410
...Emeraude.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.880
Princess Emeraude?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.850
That can't be...

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:52.290
Princess Emeraude was...

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:56.120
When she helped us
at the Spring of Eterna...

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.660
...she looked like a little girl.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.000
Are you really Princess Emeraude?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.430
I am... Emeraude.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:15.310
She does look like
the girl we saw at Eterna...

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.900
Her lovely blonde hair and
the color of her eyes are the same...

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.480
Princess Emeraude...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.040
...we are the ones from
another world that you summoned.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.720
Following
Master Mage Clef's teachings...

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.920
We received weapons
created by Master Smith Presea...

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:36.290
Guided by Mokona...

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.990
...we were able
to revive the Rune-Gods.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:43.840
Presea gave her life
to make our weapons.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.630
Clef watched over us...

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:50.200
...so we could become
Magic Knights as he promised you.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.110
He was turned
to stone by Zagato, but...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:56.080
...we defeated Zagato, so I'm sure...

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.610
Zagato...

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:05.420
What's wrong, Princess Emeraude?

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:08.020
Zagato...

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:10.550
Something's wrong.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:17.230
You were the ones
who murdered Zagato.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.930
The ones who murdered
Zagato, the man I love...

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.470
It was you!

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.210
You will pay.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.080
This is...

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.490
...inside the Rune-God?

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.820
The Rune-Gods saved us.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.740
You will not escape.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.470
It's falling apart! Outside quickly!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.420
Why...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.780
That wasn't Princess Emeraude?

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:09.190
That was the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.560
That can't be! We were summoned
by Princess Emeraude, right?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.990
Yes. Only the Pillar
of Cephiro can use the spell...

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.660
...that summons
those from another world.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:24.630
Then why were we
attacked by Princess Emeraude?

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:29.130
That was the one the Magic
Knights were meant to confront.

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:32.070
What do you mean by that?

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:48.950
This is...

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.330
Zagato's sword.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.330
Magic Knights
who murdered Zagato...

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:03.310
You'll pay.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:08.610
I will kill you with
Zagato's sword! Magic Knights!

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:13.590
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.120
I will make you pay.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.890
Magic Knights!

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.060
Amazing...

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:37.140
One blow
destroyed the entire castle...

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.180
Are you really Princess Emeraude?

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.510
Yes.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.280
I am Emeraude of Cephiro!

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:54.760
You were the one who
summoned us to Cephiro, right?

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.760
Then why are you attacking us?

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.470
What was that?

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.470
Winds of Protection!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.960
Magic Knights...

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.200
Princess Emeraude...

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.660
This voice is the one
we heard at the Spring of Eterna...

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:41.000
It is the voice of Princess
Emeraude from that time.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:45.610
Then it really isn't Princess
Emeraude in that Rune-God?

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:49.950
The real Princess Emeraude
is still imprisoned somewhere!

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:54.350
Princess Emeraude, where are you?
We'll come and save you now!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.260
No.

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:02.930
That is me.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.290
I am her.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.460
What's going on?

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:10.660
I am the one
who is in that Rune-God.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:16.840
It is me, one who chose to live for her
beloved over being Cephiro's Pillar...

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:19.180
...my foolish self.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.650
Beloved?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.870
What do you mean?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:29.180
You're the one who summoned
us from Tokyo to Cephiro, right?

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:31.660
I heard it clearly at Tokyo Tower!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.490
Save this world...

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.390
O legendary...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.260
...Magic Knights!

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.570
Yes.

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:46.940
I summoned the legendary
Magic Knights to save Cephiro.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:51.140
I thought that Cephiro would
be saved if we defeated Zagato!

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:55.510
You couldn't pray for Cephiro
because Zagato imprisoned you...

00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:00.580
...and Cephiro became an unstable
world where monsters roamed, right?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.020
That is incorrect! It wasn't Zagato's...

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.560
It wasn't his fault.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.050
It was all... It was my fault.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:14.260
Cephiro is a world where
the heart determines all.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:16.170
And the Pillar...

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:20.300
...supports the world's law and
order using the power of her will.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:26.140
The Pillar must continually pray
only for the world's stability and joy.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.370
And yet...

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.640
Yet I...

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:34.620
Zagato...

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.820
My high priest...

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.780
I fell in love with him.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.140
After I fell in love with Zagato...

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.710
...I thought of him more
often than about Cephiro.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:08.150
I had forgotten my duties
as the Pillar of Cephiro...

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.520
And Zagato...

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.960
I thought that if he
was happy, it was all right...

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.720
I started to think
such horrible thoughts.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:21.630
Then why did Zagato abduct you?

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:25.230
He realized.

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:27.760
How I felt about him.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:31.240
About the feelings that
I wanted to hide from him...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.510
And...

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.670
...Zagato loved me back.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:42.310
But our feelings were
never to come to fruit.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.080
I am the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.680
I cannot be with any one man.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.920
But I couldn't give up!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.330
I couldn't forget about him!

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.800
About him...

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.490
About Zagato...

00:14:55.940 --> 00:15:00.200
Then the reason why monsters
began roaming the land...

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:03.670
...wasn't because of Zagato?

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:09.080
Cephiro is a world of will.
If there is a heart that prays...

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:14.090
...stability can be prayed for from
anywhere no matter the obstructions.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:17.350
Then why were we summoned here?

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.590
I summoned the Magic Knights...

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:26.460
...to have you...

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.870
...kill me.

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:33.240
To kill you?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.500
The Pillar cannot choose to die.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:43.440
And no one in Cephiro
can cause the Pillar any harm.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:49.450
That is why the Pillar has a summon
spell that no one else can use.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:54.720
To summon someone outside
Cephiro, a knight from another world...

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.400
...to kill the caster.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:03.070
Then the reason why
Zagato was trying to stop us...

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:07.470
...from becoming Magic Knights
was so that we wouldn't kill you?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:11.310
Was Ferio referring to this
when he mentioned the legend?

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:16.810
When Cephiro faces crisis, Magic
Knights will appear from another world.

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:20.790
Reviving the three Rune-Gods,
they will become the Magic Knights.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:26.090
I have turned my grief
from losing Zagato into hatred...

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.750
...and created this monster.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.100
The reason that
Magic Knights don Rune-Gods...

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:37.230
...is because they cannot defeat
the Pillar with just flesh and blood.

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:41.440
The true enemy
of the Magic Knights...

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.980
...is incomparably
stronger than anyone else.

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:47.010
Be warned.

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.680
That's what he meant...

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.640
How dare you kill Zagato!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:54.250
I'll kill you...

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.120
With Zagato's sword!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:00.220
Please! I am about to disappear.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:04.090
Soon my heart will fill
with vengeance and murder.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.460
And if that happens...

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:11.590
...I am sure to pray for Cephiro's
complete destruction and annihilation!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.520
Legendary Magic Knights...

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:26.410
...kill me.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.240
And save Cephiro!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.790
That can't be...

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.330
Ms. Hikaru! Hikaru!

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.590
Magic Knights...

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:46.970
Clef...

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:54.340
You knew?
About Princess Emeraude's feelings?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.310
I knew.

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:59.880
Is there not any way to help her?

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:04.290
Any way that Princess
Emeraude does not have to die?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.550
None.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.930
Unless the current Pillar disappears,
a new Pillar will not be born.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:16.600
All Cephiro can do is wait
for the birth of a new Pillar.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.470
She only fell in love
with someone... Why?

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.240
Why does she have to die?

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:26.940
That is the promise of Cephiro.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:28.970
That can't be...

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.760
Magic Knights...

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:46.670
Please, grant Princess
Emeraude her true wish.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:49.630
Her...

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.170
...true wish?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.900
Please, Magic Knights.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.710
Grant me my true wish.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.580
Let me be with Zagato...

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:07.820
So that I only have
to think of Zagato...

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.720
So that we can be together eternally.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:17.590
Magic Knights, grant me the one
and only selfish wish of my life!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:19.590
Zagato...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:24.760
Finally, I am yours and only yours.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.340
Thank you...

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.850
Magic Knights...

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.660
That was some flash of light.

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:03.360
What do you think that was, Hikaru?

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:11.440
It wasn't a dream...

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.570
Hikaru...

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.240
Ms. Hikaru...

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:22.550
Princess Emeraude...

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.750
I want to go to Cephiro again.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:31.860
I want to go to Cephiro, and
this time, do everything that I can...

00:21:32.170 --> 00:21:37.300
...for the world Princess Emeraude,
the Pillar, nurtured so carefully.

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:11.900
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:21.050
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:29.920
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:37.760
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:44.730
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:48.570
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:55.050
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:04.780
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:13.290
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:22.270
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:31.140
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:42.590
Part One
Fin

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:52.900
The new series of Magic Knight
Rayearth is going to start!

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:56.070
We came back to Tokyo
after finishing the battle.

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:57.730
It was intense.

00:23:57.840 --> 00:23:58.970
It was.

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:02.050
But it's too early to relax.

00:24:02.150 --> 00:24:04.550
Something is going
to happen to us again.

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:08.240
A new development!
Magic Knight Rayearth!

00:24:08.350 --> 00:24:08.620
Please look forward to it!

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:10.820
A Departure and New Ties
Please look forward to it!

00:24:10.820 --> 00:24:12.660
A Departure and New Ties

00:24:12.660 --> 00:24:19.590
Who is it today?

00:24:20.130 --> 00:24:22.190
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:22.670 --> 00:24:28.630
Look forward to the next episode!
